        <activityName xml:lang="en">Adipic acid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Adipic acid, at plant
Theoretical data from process analysis. Only the most important flows are taken into account. Energy demand is estimated. More than 80% of the total production is by this process.;
CAS number: 000124-04-9; 
Formula: C6H10O4; 
Synonyms: Hexandisäure; 
UUID: 8f8b1ed3-e9ff-34b0-b886-9d4f7bfbb010
production including refining (to 99%).
Location: undefined
Technology: Nitric acid oxidation of cyclohexanol / cyclohexanone mixture (2:1) to adipic acid. Abatement of N2O emissions is assumed to reduce the emissions by 80%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 2.2 million tons per year
Sampling: theoretical model 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8f8b1ed3-e9ff-34b0-b886-9d4f7bfbb010.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
